            <profile id="3c14-2596-ee3d-78be" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, lance, light armour and shield, riding warhorses. Any unit may have heavy armour (+2 pts). May fight on foot at a reduced cost of -15 points. Ferocious Charge. May count a rank bonus of up to +1 even though cavalry. (Armies of Antiquity p.39)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
